  "body_html": "<p>Bring the vibrant beauty of the desert into your home with this stunning Jeminise cactus and floral printed quilt set. Featuring a delightful blend of bright and bold colors, this quilt set is perfect for adding a touch of nature-inspired vibrancy and coziness to any bedroom decor.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant Design:</strong> Features a lively array of cacti and flowers in rich, bold colors to add a pop of nature-inspired beauty.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt set by selecting from various sizes, adding pillowcases, or including a name to make it uniquely yours.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90''), Queen (90\"x90''), and King (102\"x91\") to fit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An unique and thoughtful gift for cactus lovers, home decor enthusiasts, or anyone who appreciates vibrant and cheerful bedding.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable for easy cleaning and low-maintenance upkeep, ensuring lasting freshness and convenience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor and outdoor use, providing warmth in all seasons, and can be used as a bed quilt, picnic mat, or throw blanket.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Style #12</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cactus, Flowers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Cactus, Desert</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Southwestern Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full(80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Text input available for personalization</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
